hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"210","Bismillāh. With the Name of Allah. Reference: Abu Dawud 4/296. Al-Albani graded it authentic in Sahih Abu Dawud 3/941."
"211","Astawdi`ukumu ‘llāha ‘l-ladhi lā taḍī`u wadā'i`uh. I place you in the trust of Allah, whose trust is never misplaced. Reference: Ahmad 2/403, Ibn Majah 2/943. See also Al-Albani, Sahih Ibn Majah 2/133."
